The source is ".L.R...LR..L..".
The last is the last position of source.
The extent is 14.
The rightforce is a list of 14 zeros.
The leftforce is a list of 14 zeros.
The verdict is a list of 14 zeros.
The lastright is -1.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The symbol is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
If symbol matches "R", set lastright to spot.
If symbol matches "L", set lastright to -1.
If lastright is at least 0, set item spot of rightforce to spot minus lastright.
If lastright is less than 0, set item spot of rightforce to extent.

The lastleft is -1.
The spot is last.
Repeat while spot is at least 0.
The symbol is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
If symbol matches "L", set lastleft to spot.
If symbol matches "R", set lastleft to -1.
If lastleft is at least 0, set item spot of leftforce to lastleft minus spot.
If lastleft is less than 0, set item spot of leftforce to extent.
Set spot to spot minus 1.

For every spot from 0 to last.
The symbol is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
If symbol matches "R", set item spot of verdict to 1.
If symbol matches "L", set item spot of verdict to 2.
If symbol matches ".".
The fromright is item spot of rightforce.
The fromleft is item spot of leftforce.
If fromright is less than fromleft, set item spot of verdict to 1.
If fromleft is less than fromright, set item spot of verdict to 2.

The result is empty text.
For each state in verdict.
If state is 0, Place "." into result.
If state is 1, Place "R" into result.
If state is 2, Place "L" into result.

Show result.
